scenario the receiver reports jamming, which is a caveat and not a refusal
describe A jammed receiver is being denied, not lied to. The honest response is
describe to keep showing the position with a caveat, and recovery has to be
describe earned rather than granted on the first quiet epoch.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted

at 2000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000010 10000010
  alt 42000
  acc 9000
  sats 8 14
  hdop 180
  jam warning
  spoof none
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason receiver-jamming
  expect validity valid

at 4000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000020 10000020
  alt 42000
  acc 14000
  sats 7 14
  hdop 220
  jam critical
  spoof none
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason receiver-jamming

# The all-clear arrives. Trust does not move on the strength of one epoch.
at 6000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000030 10000030
  alt 42000
  acc 4000
  sats 11 14
  hdop 95
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust degraded
  expect no-reason receiver-jamming

at 10000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000040 10000040
  alt 42000
  acc 3800
  sats 11 14
  hdop 92
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust degraded            # 4 s of the 5 s hold

at 11500
  fix 3d
  pos 5000050 10000050
  alt 42000
  acc 3700
  sats 12 15
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect trust trusted
